'''Ancient Egg: N207''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats Paradise (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Paradise Event Gacha]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]]. [[True Form]] massively increases overall stats, increases cost, recharge time and Weaken chance and gains [[Behemoth Slayer]] and [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]].

